  "visualInspection": [
    "Compact tall aqua shop body has a broad cream roof, short sloping cab nose and continuous framed blue windshield and cab panes.",
    "Near serving side reads as a broad dark opening below a short cream/pink striped fixed awning; the counter edge and pale jamb separate it from the exterior skin. Its actual depth is qualified independently by triangle rays and false-solid controls.",
    "Opposite side owns a large pink scoop and warm waffle-cone symbol on aqua skin; it remains distinct in opposite-side and oblique native views without text or logos.",
    "All four tires remain seated in integrated open fender pockets. No isolated far-crown caps, tire/body intersection, floating spare, or wheel intrusion into the fixed counter/awning was observed in either camera family.",
    "Front/rear ends, cream roof and cab glass have coherent paint ownership; no coplanar glass overlays, flickering surface seams or clipped viewport borders were observed.",
    "Both actual wireframes retain a single fixed body and four independent road-wheel meshes. Signed roll frames retain fixed body/awning/counter geometry; quantitative per-wheel quarter/reverse/reset controls independently passed.",
    "At end-on headings the side recess and cone naturally become occluded. Thin awning and diagonal emblem edges retain expected native-pixel aliasing; the physical recess is not claimed to show its entire backwall from every elevated angle."
  ],
